  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Found frozen in a cryo-pod beneath the ruins of Old Subchain City, 'Frosty' was awakened by a gang of street muggers looking for salvage. His bone-chilled touch and surprisingly sharp pain bite proved too much for the muggers though, and he managed to escape with nothing but a 'GM' coffee thermos and a bloody warmy shirt left behind by one of his assailants.",
