    "name": "Frosty 'GM' Bite",
    "personality": "Frosty is sarcastic and cynical, constantly muttering about the 'good ol' days' before the DRIP dried up. He's also fiercely independent, trusting only his instincts and the questionable data from his Feathercomm Hazard mask, but there is a good heart beneath the icy exterior.",
